<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Movement superglide</Major>
    <Description>This super glide has an 80% success rate (according to superglide trainer
All you have to do is bind your second jump input to "J" or whatever other key you want

That's it, working super glide or apex 6/25/25.

Happy movement</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 44 1
Delay 3 ms
KeyUp 44 1
KeyDown 13 1
Delay 3 ms
KeyUp 13 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>